6" data-grader="">۶۲ میں سے ۲۱</span> اسکول اور <span data-num="38" data-den="214" data-win="act-4w-2026-10-26" data-grader="">۲۱۴ میں سے ۳۸</span> استاد کوڈ ۴ ہفتوں یا زیادہ سے نہیں دیکھے گئے۔</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start lg:col-span-2"><p data-testid="rm-floor" class="inline-block rounded-full px-3 py-[5px] text-[12px] font-semibold leading-[1.4] bg-cp-green text-cp-navy "><span data-nonum="">کم از کم: ہر اسکول ہر ۴ ہفتوں میں</span>، <span data-window="act-4w-2026-10-26">۲۹ ستمبر تا ۲۶ اکتوبر</span></p></div></div></div></header><div class="cp-enter flex flex-col px-5 pt-4 lg:px-0 lg:pt-2"><div class="flex flex-col lg:grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.2fr)_minmax(0,1.25fr)_minmax(0,0.95fr)] lg:items-start lg:gap-x-8 lg:pt-4"><div class="flex flex-col"><section data-testid="rm-moves" data-surface="" class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[20px] bg-cp-surface p-5 shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(51,55,72,0.08)] lg:p-7 cp-overlap lg:!rounded-none lg:!bg-transparent lg:!p-0 lg:!shadow-none"><div><h2 class="text-[20px] font-bold leading-[1.3] text-cp-navy lg:text-[12px] lg:font-bold lg:uppercase lg:tracking-[0.08em] lg:text-cp-ink-3 lg:rtl:text-[13px] lg:rtl:tracking-normal">اس مہینے کی دو کمزوریاں، اسکول کے لحاظ سے</h2><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-3">اگلی گروپ نشست کا ایجنڈا</p></div><div class="flex flex-col"><div data-testid="sector-wrow" data-w="W-IP-TIME" data-state="ranked" data-wrow="sector" data-agenda="1" class="flex w-full items-start gap-3 border-t border-cp-hairline py-3.5 text-start first:border-t-0 "><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-1"><div class="grid items-start gap-x-4 gap-y-1 grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] "><span data-num="171" data-den="505" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="contents"><span class="col-start-1 row-start-1 self-end text-[17px] font-bold leading-tight text-cp-navy">۵۰۵ میں سے </span><span data-ring="row" class="relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center col-start-2 row-span-2 row-start-1 self-start" style="width: 56px; height: 56px;"><svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 56 56" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0"><circle cx="28" cy="28" r="25" fill="none" stroke-width="6" style="stroke: var(--cp-ring-track);"></circle><circle data-arc="" class="cp-ring__arc" cx="28" cy="28" r="25" fill="none" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="53.19 157.08" transform="rotate(-90 28 28)" style="stroke: var(--cp-green); --cp-arc-len: 53.19;"></circle></svg><span class="cp-ring__n font-extrabold text-[17px] leading-none">۱۷۱</span></span></span><div class="col-start-1 row-start-2 min-w-0"><p class="text-[16px] font-semibold leading-snug text-cp-ink">وقت ختم ہو گیا</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[14px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2">جن اسباق کے منصوبے میں خود مشق شامل تھی، ان میں مشق سے پہلے ہی وقت ختم ہو گیا۔</p></div></div><ul data-testid="by-school" class="mt-2 flex flex-col"><li data-testid="by-school-row" class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 py-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink"><span class="[&amp;_[data-code]]:inline-block [&amp;_[data-num]]:whitespace-nowrap"><span data-code="" dir="ltr" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">⁦Govt. Primary School Fictional-17⁩</span>، <span data-num="7" data-den="12" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash">۱۲ میں سے ۷</span> اسباق</span><span aria-hidden="true" data-bar="7/12" class="block h-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-cp-track w-full"><span data-fill="" class="block h-full rounded-full bg-cp-green" style="width: 58.333333333333336%;"></span></span></li><li data-testid="by-school-row" class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 py-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink"><span class="[&amp;_[data-code]]:inline-block [&amp;_[data-num]]:whitespace-nowrap"><span data-code="" dir="ltr" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">⁦Govt. Primary School Fictional-03⁩</span>، <span data-num="6" data-den="9" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash">۹ میں سے ۶</span> اسباق</span><span aria-hidden="true" data-bar="6/9" class="block h-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-cp-track w-full"><span data-fill="" class="block h-full rounded-full bg-cp-green" style="width: 66.66666666666666%;"></span></span></li><li data-testid="by-school-row" class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 py-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink"><span class="[&amp;_[data-code]]:inline-block [&amp;_[data-num]]:whitespace-nowrap"><span data-code="" dir="ltr" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">⁦Govt. Primary School Fictional-24⁩</span>، <span data-num="6" data-den="10" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash">۱۰ میں سے ۶</span> اسباق</span><span aria-hidden="true" data-bar="6/10" class="block h-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-cp-track w-full"><span data-fill="" class="block h-full rounded-full bg-cp-green" style="width: 60%;"></span></span></li></ul><p data-window="w4-2026-09-28" class="text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-3">۲۸ ستمبر تا ۲۵ اکتوبر، سبق کے منصوبے پر عمل، نمبر دینے کا طریقہ ۲۸ ستمبر کو بدلا</p></span></div><div data-testid="sector-wrow" data-w="W-WARM" data-state="not_yet" data-wrow="sector" class="flex w-full items-start gap-3 border-t border-cp-hairline py-3.5 text-start first:border-t-0 "><span data-ring="row" class="relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center me-1" style="width: 56px; height: 56px;"><svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 56 56" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0"><circle cx="28" cy="28" r="25" fill="none" stroke-width="6" style="stroke: var(--cp-ring-track);"></circle></svg></span><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-1"><p class="text-[16px] font-semibold leading-snug text-cp-ink">ابتدائی سرگرمی نہیں ہوئی</p><p data-num="2" data-den="3" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="text-[13.5px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2">سیکٹر بھر میں ابھی کافی ریکارڈنگز نہیں: ۵ اسباق والے ۳ میں سے ۲ کوچ</p><p data-window="w4-2026-09-28" class="text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-3">۲۸ ستمبر تا ۲۵ اکتوبر، سبق کے منصوبے پر عمل، نمبر دینے کا طریقہ ۲۸ ستمبر کو بدلا</p></span></div></div></section><p data-testid="rm-coverage" class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1 pt-4 text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-3"><span data-num="2" data-den="62" data-win="act-4w-2026-10-26" data-grader="">۶۲ میں سے ۲ اسکول کسی کوچ کے پاس نہیں</span><span data-num="1" data-den="10" data-win="act-4w-2026-10-26" data-grader="">۱۰ میں سے ۱ کوچ جن کے پاس کوئی اسکول نہیں</span></p></div><section data-testid="coach-groups" data-section="" class="mt-5 border-t border-cp-hairline pt-6 lg:mt-0 lg:border-t-0 lg:pt-0"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="cp-label text-[12px] font-bold uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.08em] text-cp-ink-3">اس ہفتے کس کوچ کو میری ضرورت ہے</p><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-3">صرف کوچنگ کی سرگرمی، نمبر نہیں<span data-testid="window-legend" class="inline">، <span><span data-window="act-4w-2026-10-26">۲۹ ستمبر تا ۲۶ اکتوبر</span></span><span>، <span data-window="act-m-2026-10">۱ اکتوبر تا ۳۱ اکتوبر</span></span></span></p></div></div><div class="mt-2"><div data-testid="group-needs_me"><div class="mt-4 flex flex-col"><p class="cp-label text-[12px] font-bold uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.08em] text-cp-green-ink">اس ہفتے میری ضرورت</p></div><ul><li data-testid="coach-row" data-coach="00000000-0000-4000-8000-070000000003" class="flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-cp-hairline py-4 first:border-t-0 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-3"><a class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col rounded-xl outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-cp-green sm:flex-row" href="/portal/rm/coach/00000000-0000-4000-8000-070000000003"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-start gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-cp-green-tint text-[14px] font-bold text-cp-green-ink">C</span><span class="flex min-w-0 fle