ill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-dot" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1"></circle></svg><span>حلقہ</span></a><a data-nav="stats" class="flex min-h-[48px] min-w-[60px] flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-[3px] whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl text-[11px] font-semibold outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-cp-green text-cp-ink-3 [&amp;_svg]:text-cp-ink-2" href="/portal/rm/stats"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-column" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"></path><path d="M18 17V9"></path><path d="M13 17V5"></path><path d="M8 17v-3"></path></svg><span>جائزہ</span></a></nav><div class="lg:ps-[240px]"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[640px] lg:px-16 lg:pt-9 lg:max-w-[848px]"><div class=" pb-[calc(96px+env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] lg:pb-16"><div class="min-w-0"><header data-testid="rm-band" class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-cp-hairline bg-cp-surface px-5 pb-3 pt-4 lg:border-0 lg:bg-transparent lg:px-0 lg:pb-4 lg:pt-0"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><h1 class="break-words text-[24px] font-extrabold leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.01em] text-cp-navy [overflow-wrap:anywhere] lg:text-[30px]">⁦Urban-I⁩، کوچ</h1></div><span class="lg:hidden"><div dir="ltr" data-lang-toggle="" class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 rounded-full p-1 border border-cp-hairline bg-white "><button type="button" data-testid="rm-lang-en" aria-pressed="false" class="min-h-[44px] min-w-[48px] rounded-full px-3 text-[14px] font-semibold outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-cp-green text-cp-ink-2">EN</button><button type="button" data-testid="rm-lang-ur" aria-pressed="true" class="min-h-[44px] min-w-[48px] rounded-full px-3 text-[14px] font-semibold outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-cp-green bg-cp-navy text-white">اردو</button></div></span></header><div class="cp-enter flex flex-col px-5 pt-4 lg:px-0 lg:pt-2"><section data-testid="coach-groups" data-section="" class=" pt-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="cp-label text-[12px] font-bold uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.08em] text-cp-ink-3">اس ہفتے کس کوچ کو میری ضرورت ہے</p><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-3">صرف کوچنگ کی سرگرمی، نمبر نہیں<span data-testid="window-legend" class="inline">، <span><span data-window="act-4w-2026-10-26">۲۹ ستمبر تا ۲۶ اکتوبر</span></span><span>، <span data-window="act-m-2026-10">۱ اکتوبر تا ۳۱ اکتوبر</span></span></span></p></div></div><div class="mt-2"><div data-testid="group-needs_me"><div class="mt-4 flex flex-col"><p class="cp-label text-[12px] font-bold uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.08em] text-cp-green-ink">اس ہفتے میری ضرورت</p></div><ul><li data-testid="coach-row" data-coach="00000000-0000-4000-8000-070000000003" class="flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-cp-hairline py-4 first:border-t-0 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-3"><a class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col rounded-xl outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-cp-green sm:flex-row" href="/portal/rm/coach/00000000-0000-4000-8000-070000000003"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-start gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-cp-green-tint text-[14px] font-bold text-cp-green-ink">C</span><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-0.5 text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2"><span data-testid="coach-label" data-code="" dir="auto" class="text-[16px] font-semibold leading-snug text-cp-ink">C-03</span><span data-num="1" data-den="6" data-win="act-4w-2026-10-26" data-grader="">۴ ہفتوں میں ۶ میں سے ۱ اسکولوں کا دورہ نہیں ہوا</span><span data-num="3" data-den="5" data-win="act-m-2026-10" data-grader="">اس مہینے ۵ میں سے ۳ بات چیت ایک قدم پر ختم ہوئیں</span><span data-num="1" data-den="1" data-win="act-4w-2026-10-26" data-grader="">۲۶ اکتوبر تک کی ۱ میں سے ۱ جانچیں باقی ہیں</span><span data-testid="note-open" class="text-[12px] text-cp-ink-3">یاد دہانی، بھیجی گئی</span></span></span></a><button type="button" data-testid="follow-up" class="cp-press inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-cp-navy focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 border-2 border-cp-navy bg-white text-cp-navy min-h-[44px] rounded-[12px] px-4 text-[14px] font-semibold  ms-[52px] shrink-0 self-start sm:ms-0"><span>یاد دہانی</span></button></li><li data-testid="coach-row" data-coach="00000000-0000-4000-8000-070000000002" class="flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-cp-hairline py-4 first:border-t-0 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-3"><a class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col rounded-xl outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-cp-green sm:flex-row" href="/portal/rm/coach/00000000-0000-4000-8000-070000000002"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-start gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-cp-green-tint text-[14px] font-bold text-cp-green-ink">C</span><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-0.5 text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2"><span data-testid="coach-label" data-code="" dir="auto" class="text-[16px] font-semibold leading-snug text-cp-ink">C-02</span><span data-num="2" data-den="7" data-win="act-4w-2026-10-26" data-grader="">۴ ہفتوں میں ۷ میں سے ۲ اسکولوں کا دورہ نہیں ہوا</span><span data-num="4" data-den="6" data-win="act-m-2026-10" data-grader="">اس مہینے ۶ میں سے ۴ بات چیت ایک قدم پر ختم ہوئیں</span><span data-num="0" data-den="2" data-win="act-4w-2026-10-26" data-grader="">۲۶ اکتوبر تک کی ۲ میں سے ۰ جانچیں باقی ہیں</span></span></span></a><button type="button" data-testid="follow-up" cl